      "relation": "山上云隐寺新任的住持，今年四月刚接了老住持慧明的位子；每年盂兰盆都来雾见屋送火诵经，甄鹤年年年给寺里捐香火钱，见了你总是客客气气。",
      "publicInfo": "何了尘，二十四岁，山上黄檗宗云隐寺的住持，今年头一回以讲述人的身份参加雾见屋的百物语，顺带主持送火与诵经。",
      "portrait": "ukiyo-e woodblock print portrait illustration of a 24-year-old Chinese man, an overseas Chinese Buddhist priest of an Obaku Zen temple in rural Japan, 1985 Showa era, freshly shaved head, calm pale narrow face, thin eyebrows, black priest's robe with a plain brown kesa stole over the shoulder, a dark wooden rosary in one hand, quiet composed expression, Prussian blue and vermilion accents on cream washi paper, half-length shot",
