      "portrait": "ukiyo-e woodblock print portrait illustration of a 44-year-old Chinese man, an overseas Chinese head chef (itamae) of an old Japanese hot-spring inn, 1985 Showa era, round broad face, thick neck and heavy shoulders, short black hair under a white hachimaki headband, white cook's jacket with sleeves tied back by a cord, burn scars on his forearms, a kitchen knife in hand, wary uneasy expression, Prussian blue and vermilion accents on cream washi paper, half-length shot",
